WEBVTT

00:16:55.146 --> 00:17:00.762
Ja sam rekao: "Znam to sve -- koji je danas dan?"

00:17:00.762 --> 00:17:07.786
Znate, znao sam da je auto probio zaštitnu ogradu
28. februara

00:17:07.786 --> 00:17:11.435
i znao sam da je 1976. prestupna godina.

00:17:11.435 --> 00:17:16.145
"Sestro, da li je 28. ili 29.?"

00:17:16.145 --> 00:17:18.138
Pogledala me je i rekla:

00:17:18.138 --> 00:17:20.713
"Sad je 1. mart."

00:17:20.713 --> 00:17:23.194
"Bože,

00:17:23.194 --> 00:17:25.730
šta sve moram da uradim!"

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.402
Od tog momenta sam znao

00:17:28.402 --> 00:17:31.650
da mi je ta nesreća zadata;